flowchart TB
accTitle: Evidence gates image approval
accDescr: Candidate instances undergo application tests and Inspector scans. Only completed passing evidence publishes an approved AMI, and the 30-day schedule starts a new image build.
S[30-day rebuild schedule]:::inputData --> B[Build new candidate AMI]:::output
B --> T[Launch isolated test instance]:::inputData
T --> X[Application tests]:::decision
T --> I[Inspector scan<br/>Verify coverage and completion]:::decision
X --> G{Both reviews pass?}:::decision
I --> G
G -->|No| F[Repair and rebuild]:::warning
F --> B
G -->|Yes| P[Publish approved AMI ID<br/>Protected Parameter Store]:::output
P --> L[Production launch path]:::output
L --> R[Running EC2 fleet]:::output
M[Patch Manager<br/>Approved fleet maintenance]:::decision --> R
